# AUDIT/livekit-production-readiness.md
**Date:** 2026-06-07
**Auditor:** RALD CTO
**Scope:** Loop LiveKit integration — audio rooms, participant lifecycle, reconnect, mobile handling
**Phase:** Production Hardening Phase 2 — Phase 1

