## Executive Summary

The LiveKit integration is production-ready for closed beta at the current scale. The Worker-level
API (token generation, room management via LiveKit REST) is fully deployed and live. The frontend
SDK (`livekit-client`) is integrated with graceful degradation when env vars are absent.

**Production Score: 8.5/10 (closed beta ready; 3 open items for public launch)**

