## Failure Points

| Failure | Impact | Detection | Recovery |
|---------|--------|-----------|---------|
| LiveKit cloud outage | All audio rooms silent | Health probe → livekit check | Incident runbook → LiveKit status page |
| LIVEKIT_API_KEY rotated without Worker secret update | Token endpoint 500 | Health probe degraded | Re-push secret via `wrangler secret put` |
| ROOM_SESSION DO evicted | Raise-hand state lost | User reports | State auto-reconstructs on next raise-hand |
| WebSocket drop during room | Participant goes silent | livekit-client reconnect event | Automatic — SDK handles within 30s |
| Token endpoint overloaded | High latency on room join | /api/health + CF analytics | CF auto-scales Worker; LiveKit tokens are fast |

